sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>UsersPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ChangeAccountStatusBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ChangeAccountStatusController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: suspend or reactivate an account
  UI->>B: PATCH /api/admin/users/{id}/status (JWT)
  B->>C: changeStatus(Integer adminId, Integer userId, AccountStatus status)
  alt own account or deleted account
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>User: changeStatus()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C->>User: save()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: AdminUserResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end